  intro hA D Γ _ _ Pl0 I0 T A3 Ks _ _ _ R F cG kKs hk Rw Pq hL eig θ Bs Sb v₀ hF pins intersectionNumber_baseChange hv hK hH hSb hτ cs hV hsp hPq hch hQ
    ⟨Z, hZ⟩ hstd
